    "_readme": "CES Menu add-ons (like vMenu's addons.json).Entries can be a plain model-name string or an object with a label/category. Hashes can be hex strings (\"0x8FFCF06B\") or names. After editing, run 'cesmenu_reloadaddons' in the server console - no restart needed. Copy entries from _examples into the real lists; _examples itself is ignored.",

